('boulevard tour + heydar aliyev centre',NULL,'Hotel','Hotel','30',30,'PrivateTransfer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Walking tour starts along the Baku Boulevard followed by: -Mini Venice of Baku  -Carpet Museum -Deniz Mall   -Ferries Wheel ride   -Carpet Museums  -Boat cruise   -Cristal Hall  -Biking Area + Visit to Heydar Aliyev Center for PHOTO SHOOTING    & “I LOVE BAKU” sign for PHOTOSTOP (entry to Vintage Car Museums)  (If it’s first time of your arrival to Baku, just be aware of   that from the bird view you can clearly see the Heydar   Aliyev’s Signature on the Heydar Aliyev’s Center design.   It’s a wave-like building rises from a bed of concrete.  Its immobile white walls look as though they have been   frozen mid-ripple. The abstract architecture is unlike anything   else in the capital city. The Heydar Aliyev Center, which was   designed by renowned architect Zaha Hadid.)',NULL,NULL,'Sedan - 4 Seaters (Local Speaking)',30.0),
